{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-me-downs is a roguelike deck builder where your opponents use your own cards against you, so you need to carefully consider what to play each round.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your opponents don't have their own deck, so they borrow your cards!  <br>Each time you play a hand, your opponent takes the cards from your hand and uses them against you the next time you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience the core of the full game with a limited selection of content available.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This demo will introduce you to all the core game mechanics while providing a carefully selected fraction of opponents, decks and trinkets that will be available in the full release.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4041190?t=1759423035","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041190/4a37b1d1f507a511811dc7cb8a17f5fb4d01b254/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759423035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041190/3ed93f6de9c252a6340ebbc0ebbff5ef072cad98/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759423035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041190/3ed93f6de9c252a6340ebbc0ebbff5ef072cad98/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759423035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hand-me-downs is a roguelike deck builder where your opponents use your own cards against you, so you need to carefully consider what to play each round.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your opponents don't have their own deck, so they borrow your cards!  <br>Each time you play a hand, your opponent takes the cards from your hand and uses them against you the next time you meet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Experience the core of the full game with a limited selection of content available.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This demo will introduce you to all the core game mechanics while providing a carefully selected fraction of opponents, decks and trinkets that will be available in the full release.</p>","developers":["Buggy Deduck"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3870620","name":"Hand-me-downs"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4041190/25bb3806041c16d8b1ab5d2f33920b75e04a47c8/header.jpg?t=1759423035","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041190/1464084575/a5fa2f0bd83975f9b1abc0aa3bb68f23a2bb1427/1758792356/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758837250","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041190/1464084575/a5fa2f0bd83975f9b1abc0aa3bb68f23a2bb1427/1758792356/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758837250","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4041190/1464084575/a5fa2f0bd83975f9b1abc0aa3bb68f23a2bb1427/1758792356/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758837250","id":257206034,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257206034/movie480.mp4?t=1758837250","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2572